{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>לי עצה ותושיה</b> — the meaning is explicit: <b>אני בינה</b> — I am insight; <b>לי גבורה</b> — mine is strength. And he said 'I am insight' and did not say 'to me insight,' because insight is an offshoot of wisdom, and if there is no wisdom there is no insight. And he said 'mine is strength,' in the sense of: 'wisdom gives strength to the wise man more than ten rulers' (Ecclesiastes 7:19)."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:21:25.772013802Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}